        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>手写笔记页 — 我是未来的光</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #dcd8cf;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Kaiti SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #e9e5dc;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  /* 上半部分：拼贴画区域 */\n  .collage {\n    height: 350px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #8a8579;\n    color: #5c584f;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n  }\n  .ph-notebook-left {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0; top: 0;\n    width: 130px; height: 350px;\n  }\n  .ph-art-main {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 120px; top: 0;\n    width: 420px; height: 350px;\n  }\n  /* 下半部分：横线信纸手写区域 */\n  .notes {\n    padding: 14px 22px 26px 30px;\n    background:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(\n        to bottom,\n        #e9e5dc 0px,\n        #e9e5dc 25px,\n        #c9c2b3 25px,\n        #c9c2b3 26px\n      );\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n    color: #2b2b33;\n  }\n  .notes p {\n    margin: 0;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .blue {\n    color: #2b3f8c;\n  }\n  .hl {\n    background: #cfe86b;\n  }\n  .signature {\n    margin-top: 26px;\n    color: #2b3f8c;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"collage\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder ph-notebook-left\">[Photo: 左侧横线笔记本页面，贴有浅紫、浅黄剪纸花草图案]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder ph-art-main\">[Collage artwork: 中上部拼贴画，蓝色与橙色斜向纸条、剪纸小鸟排列于顶部、紫色薰衣草与绿叶、水墨黑鸟吹奏、右侧橙色狐狸与花草]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"notes\">\n    <p>敝的房子，让黑夜破间的灯，让水流里面的渠，寻找梦想的路，寻找</p>\n    <p>开束理时的枷锁，读懂生命的奥义</p>\n    <p class=\"indent\">却不是循规蹈矩，那是霍早的规矩，是不倍明目黑暗，仍然为无明亮</p>\n    <p>生的心。</p>\n    <p class=\"indent blue\">我是未来的光，照耀未来之前的自己。</p>\n    <p class=\"indent blue\">情怀与理想并不相悖，美好与前进可以并行</p>\n    <p class=\"indent blue\">情怀依旧火热，灵魂依旧灼烧，理想依旧滚烫，向光的步伐依</p>\n    <p class=\"blue\">旧不止。</p>\n    <p class=\"indent\">清晨的草原空气甘甜，吐鲁番早市的甜瓜新鲜，拉萨的雪山一眼</p>\n    <p>望不到尽头，泰山攀岩，只为遇见威手，丽江大理苔古城，哈尔滨的冰</p>\n    <p>雕流连，昊然刺阳，匆匆告别，拥抱陌生的人，吻别可爱的小城，小采浮孔</p>\n    <p>入生活，吸忙生活的骨髓。</p>\n    <p class=\"indent\">你在其间，独一无二，不可或缺。无论你是何种角色，都不要被</p>\n    <p>历史的大潮淹没，或者冲刷去你的独立存在。至少你要在大时代中做<span class=\"hl\">个坚</span></p>\n    <p><span class=\"hl\">强的小人物，在狂欢夜中做个自由的舞者。</span></p>\n    <p class=\"signature\">— 刘拓：用生命为文物留影的年轻人</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
